[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      7[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      8[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Axis E — entry point** (from `c_src/include/staticalias.h`, the complete
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      9[0m:[38;5;10m[49m public API — two symbols, no others; see `SYMBOLS.md`):
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     10[0m:[38;5;10m[49m - `E1` = `static_alias` called **directly** — the lowest-level entry point.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     11[0m:[38;5;10m[49m - `E2` = `driver` — the convenience/one-shot wrapper that loops `static_alias`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     12[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   and `printf`s. Its stdout is part of its observable output.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     13[0m:[38;5;10m[49m - `E3` = **interleaved** `E1` and `E2` on the same loaded library, exercising the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     14[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   interaction through the shared `static int inner`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     15[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     16[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Axis B — branch of `if (*outer >= inner)` (`staticalias.c:30`):**
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     17[0m:[38;5;10m[49m - `B1` = then-branch (`*outer >= inner`): `inner += *outer`, **returns `&inner`**.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     18[0m:[38;5;10m[49m - `B2` = else-branch (`*outer < inner`): `*outer += inner`, **returns `outer`**.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     19[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     20[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Axis A — aliasing of the argument** (the reason this library exists; `driver`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     21[0m:[38;5;10m[49m feeds the returned pointer straight back in, so after any `B1` the argument
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     22[0m:[38;5;10m[49m *is* `&inner`):
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     23[0m:[38;5;10m[49m - `A1` = `outer` points at a caller-owned object distinct from `inner`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     24[0m:[38;5;10m[49m - `A2` = `outer == &inner` (aliased) ⇒ `B1` computes `inner + inner` and `B2` is
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     25[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   unreachable (`inner >= inner` is always true).
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     26[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
