[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     28[0m:[38;5;10m[49m process-global and survives across calls; `inner` starts at 1):
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     29[0m:[38;5;10m[49m - `S1` = fresh library, `inner == 1`.
