[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     34[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     35[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Axis V — value shape of `*outer` / `initial_value`** (every `int` is accepted;
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     36[0m:[38;5;10m[49m the code distinguishes only via `>=`, but the *arithmetic* is value-dependent):
