[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     41[0m:[38;5;10m[49m - `I0` = 0, `I1` = negative, `I2` = 1, `I3` = 2 (first state carry-over),
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     42[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `I4` = many (3…4096, exercises the `B1`→aliased-`A2` steady state).
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     43[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
